Implement MiniMax H3 base model import and quantization

Upstream ships MiniMax H3 inference and LoRA import but converts the base
model out of tree. The importer arms are lifted from LoRAImporter's working
.minimaxH3 wiring. The quantizer recipe reproduces the catalog's own i8x and
q6p files, which keep the token refiner, embedders and output heads raw and
palettize adaLN at q8p.
